Upstream repository: https://github.com/mos9527/evbunpack
Source commit: ee7b647acf2a46617b0c448dfa83d63132ea917b
Original files: evbunpack/__main__.py and evbunpack/const.py

Changes made on 2026-10-14: only the modern external-tree structure reader is
retained. PE restoration, decompression, command-line behavior, third-party
dependencies and all file writes are removed. Explicit bounds, filename and
node-count checks replace assertions and implicit EOF termination.

